The company depicted, "Grounded Home Services," is fictional, as are its
staff, customers, service area, and financial figures. All of it is produced
by the deterministic generator in src/demo/. Every phone number falls within
the 555-01XX block that the North American Numbering Plan permanently reserves
for fictional use.

